<title>USA: Eastman Chemical opens LatAm headquarters.</title>
<headline>Eastman Chemical opens LatAm headquarters.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Chemical Co said it has opened an office here to serve as its headquarters for the Latin American region.</p>
<p>Eastman, a major chemicals, fibers and plastics manufacturer based in Kingsport, Tenn., said it posted $306 million sales to Latin America in 1996, out of company sales totalling $4.8 billion.</p>
<p>It said it will initially have 12 people at the new office, with plans to increase the number to 30 by year-end.</p>
